    "title": "Hilton India South Asia Partners is Hiring: Guest Relations Manager (Junior)",
    "description": "Hilton India South Asia Partners invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Guest Relations Manager at our Jabalpur location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Hilton India South Asia Partners:\nHilton India South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Train and supervise front-line staff on service standards\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Hilton India South Asia Partners!",
